<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5840" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφι-θᾰλής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαλεῖν</span>) lit. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>blooming on both sides,</i> of children <i>who have
				both parents alive,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				22.496
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				927d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Iamb.</u>
				3.1.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				589.19
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Magn.
			</span></i> Mae.), etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>flourishing on all sides,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χωρίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					1.239
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <i>all-abounding,</i> of gods, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				394
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἔρως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					1737
				</span></i>
			 (cf. Sch.); of a man, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόσις ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.1863
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφιθαλὴς κακοῖς</span>
			<i>abounding in</i> . . , <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1144
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of things,
				<i>complete,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλήθεια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ax.</u>
					370d
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
